mindmap
  root((MD Diagram Conversion))
    User Stories
      S-01 Diagram button in header
      S-02 AI generates diagram source
      S-03 Sidecar persists across reload
      S-04 Gallery panel with cards
      S-05 Mermaid renders as SVG
      S-06 ASCII renders in pre
      S-07 PlantUML shows source
      S-08 Lightbox zoom/pan
      S-09 Delete a diagram card
      S-10 Regenerate a diagram card
      S-11 Panel auto-opens on complete
      S-12 TypeScript clean
      S-13 Theme re-render
    Editor Header
      Before feature
        Split + Analyze pills
      After feature
        Diagram pill added
      Pill Segments
        Run generates diagram
        Gear opens PromptPeekModal
        Gallery chip opens panel
      Pill States
        idle
        running spinner
        done chip
        error red border
    Modals
      PromptPeekModal
        Renders anywhere
          Flowchart Mermaid
          Sequence Mermaid
          Mindmap Mermaid
          Architecture Mermaid
          Boxes ASCII
        Needs engine
          UML PlantUML
      SendPreviewModal
        Style Engine File summary
        Prompt preview
        Cancel or Run
    Components
      EditorHeader
        ActionPill Diagram
      DiagramGalleryPanel
        DiagramCard
          Style badge
          Thumbnail preview
          View Regen Delete
        DiagramRender
          MermaidView SVG
          ASCII pre block
          PlantUML source
        DiagramLightbox
          zoom 0.5x to 4x
          drag to pan
    File Structure
      EditorHeader slash
        diagramPresets.ts
        editorCli.ts
        useEditorDiagramAction.ts
      DiagramGalleryPanel slash
        diagramSidecar.ts
        useDiagramSidecar.ts
        DiagramCard
        DiagramRender
        DiagramLightbox
      store slash uiStore.ts
    Data Flow
      User clicks Run
      Selects preset
      Confirms spawn
      PTY opens terminal tab
      Agent writes sidecar
      Poll for diagrams.json
      Gallery auto-opens
    Sidecar Format
      version 1
      source filename
      diagrams array
        id dg_XXXXX
        title and style
        content source
        status kept or draft
        engine and model
        createdAt ISO-8601
    State Machine
      NONE undefined
      RUNNING spinner Diagramming
      DONE chip N panel opens
      ERROR red border toast
    Mermaid Pipeline
      lazy import mermaid
      Read CSS token values
      Initialize with theme
      Render to SVG
      Theme flip re-renders
    Delivery Milestones
      Conv 0 Preflight scan
      Conv 1 State scaffold
      Conv 2 Sidecar and hook
      Conv 3 Pill in header
      Conv 4 Gallery and cards
      Conv 5 Render and lightbox
      Conv 6 Polish and verify